		answer: `Yes. Father's Heart Bible™ is free to read online in Burmese (မြန်မာဘာသာ) — all 66 books, no account, no purchase, no app — at fathersheartbible.com/read/my/. Start with John 3 or Psalm 23. The English edition is free too, with audio.`,
	},
	{
