		answer: `Yes. The Burmese edition is free to read at fathersheartbible.com/read/my/. Burmese is the official language of Myanmar and is spoken by about ${sp('my')} people.`,
	},
	{
		question: 'Which other languages of Myanmar can I read the Bible in here?',
		answer: `English is free to read at fathersheartbible.com/read/, with audio on every chapter. Myanmar has many other peoples and languages, among them Karen, Kachin, Chin and Shan.`,
